					<!--intro block-->
					<div id="main-intro-block" class="intro-block mb-5">
						<header class="pt-5 pb-4">
							<h1>Gennadius Digital Resources</h1>
						</header>
						
							<div class="row">
								<div class="col column caption">
									<p><a href="https://www3.ascsa.edu.gr/index-gennadius.html"><strong>Digital Library</strong></a></p>

<p>We understand that not everyone can come in person at the Gennadius Library so we try our best to facilitate your research.</p>

<p>As always, you can search our online catalogue <a href="http://ambrosia.ascsa.edu.gr:8991/F">AMBROSIA</a>. Our Library staff can scan a limited number of materials on demand. The limit is 50 pages per week, and the material will be delivered within a week.</p>

<p>We remind you of the <a href="https://www.ascsa.edu.gr/researchers/electronic-resources-lib">e-journal titles and online databases</a> that are available to our readers. Do not hesitate to contact us for the links restricted to the ASCSA Domain.</p>

<p>For any of these Library services please contact the Librarian, <a href="mailto:isolomonidi.genn@ascsa.edu.gr">Irini Solomonidi</a> &nbsp;</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						
					</div><!--intro block-->
					
					
					
					

					
					
